    "summary": "Whenever a **PLAGUE LEGIONS** unit is tested for [Battle-shock](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock) 12″ or closer to the bearer, apply a +1 bonus to its roll. On a pass, one of its models recovers lost wounds, up to D3. A passing **BATTLELINE** unit may get back up to D3 of its destroyed models in place of healing.",
